\sum_t\mathbb E_{\bar P}\left[
\sup_a \mathbb E_{\theta\mid\mathcal I_t}
  \mathbb E_\theta[r_t(a)\mid \mathcal I_t]
\right],
\]
and minimax regret is at least this Bayes regret by averaging/Yao.
